@startuml
title Data Usage - End of session

participant "SmartPhone" as Phone #purple
participant "NetworkFunction" as NF #lightblue
participant "CCS_ChargingFunction" as CCF #lightblue

box "ServiceBalanceManagement"
  participant "CCS_AccountBalanceMgmt" as ABMF #blue
  participant "CCS_RatingFunction" as RF #blue
end box

box "ServiceUsageManagement"
  participant "CCS_ChargingDataFunction" as CDF #blue
  participant "CCS_ChargingGatewayFunction" as CGF #blue
end box

Phone -> NF : 1 data session finished
activate NF
NF -> CCF : 2 finalize data session
activate CCF

CCF -> CCF : 3 determine final value

CCF -> ABMF : 4 debit balance
activate ABMF
note right of ABMF : debits the balance and\nreleases any unused reservation
ABMF -> ABMF : 5 balance debited
ABMF --> CCF : 6 debit balance successful
deactivate ABMF

CCF --> NF : 7 finalization completed
deactivate NF

CCF -> CDF : 8 Close CDR
activate CDF
CDF -> CGF : 9 Finalized CDR
note right of CGF : the finalized event is stored and\navailable for further distribution
CDF --> CCF : 10 CDR Closed
deactivate CDF
deactivate CCF

@enduml
